:7,"created_at":"2025-06-16T10:19:32Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T23:16:26Z","closed_at":"2025-10-01T23:08:02Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107587","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-01T23:08:01Z"},"body":"Cross-includes are our main compile time problem right now. Not only does parsing take long, also every small change to a header file leads to hundreds of recompilations of compile units. It's time to do something.\r\n\r\n`STATIC_ASSERT_INCOMPLETE_TYPE` is designed to protect ourselves against unnecessary includes. It lets us enforce certain couplings are not made, such as an include to `dictionary.h` from `ustring.h`. The assertion is made only for release build, to avoid interfering with the development cycle.\r\n(This check was originally made for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107492, but I split it off to make it easier to discuss it separately).\r\n\r\nI enforce 3 assumptions in this PR that already hold (no `Dictionary` include from `String`, and `Dictionary` and `String` from `Array`). There are many others we should be making. This is left to do as follow-up PRs (e.g. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106434).\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107587/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107587/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}